      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/franklin_park_florida",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The North Fork of the New River runs through Franklin Park, adding a natural waterway to the neighborhood’s landscape.",
